      "image": "assets/images/10776/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, drop teaspoonfuls of dough into a bowl of confectioners' sugar. Roll dough in sugar until lightly coated, then place 2 inches apart onto ungreased cookie sheets.",
